{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"Ozgur does not hesitate to enter the room first, and his horns catch on the door way causing him to step back and enter sideways. \"Bugger! Ahem, Kia ora captain, I'd like to inquire about a job onboard your fine vessel.\"","created_at":"2020-07-18T19:25:29.637000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734128733996187709","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
