{"attachments":[{"content_type":null,"filename":"Captain_Amaya.jpg","id":"734129097449406464","local_path":"discord/roanoke-season-3/attachments/636706468116037642/734129097449406464-Captain_Amaya.jpg","message_id":"734129097747333272","sha256":"400254b2ed61911dd58c0e1f431c5e06d138bf5b39744edf589c506da92287c6","size":1557994,"url":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/636706468116037642/734129097449406464/Captain_Amaya.jpg?ex=6ac00580&is=6abeb400&hm=4122d5e9fcbde4cf070ea65ebce6497eab5c2003ab0192f021dc55c545cedfcf&"}],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"The Ships captain is here going about her buisness","created_at":"2020-07-18T19:26:56.362000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734129097747333272","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"Ozgur blinks suddenly finding himself in a competitive job market. \"Well... I'm very good at lifting things. Oh! And moving them to other places.\"","created_at":"2020-07-18T19:27:23.043000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734129209655558225","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"\"Yes, but can you obey orders? Can you think on your feet?\"","created_at":"2020-07-18T19:28:22.640000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734129459623493693","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"Ozgur's brow furrows as he glances down at his hooves, lifting one and setting it back down on the floor. \"... Yees? I do that quite regularly actually.\" Ozgur says satisfied that he is infact thinking on his feet.","created_at":"2020-07-18T19:29:43.913000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734129800507293719","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"\"Well alright then. Pandy will set you up with a standard contract. I will expect a full day's work from you from now until we set sail...so to speak.\"","created_at":"2020-07-18T19:30:52.870000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734130089733652560","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"\"Don't cause any trouble, and we'll get along just fine.\"","created_at":"2020-07-18T19:31:23.514000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734130218263904330","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"Ozgur smiles and salutes with the wrong hand. \"Thankyou capatain! I am excited to have the opportunity to be able to work on your crew.\"","created_at":"2020-07-18T19:32:01.570000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734130377882599495","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"\"Now get out both of you. I'm very busy.\" Pandy salutes sharply and turns to leave.","created_at":"2020-07-18T19:32:10.366000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734130414775435374","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
