{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"Pandy get's the forms for you to sign. The standard contract gets you a week's pay plus a good chunk of an advance on your hazard pay. If you make it back to London, you will receive the remainder at the end of the mission, but for now, you receive an additional 140 gold for your work this week.","created_at":"2020-07-18T19:35:19.990000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734131210116399135","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"Ozgur signs his name enthusiastically \"So Lieutenant, as a member of the crew, do I still need to pay for quarters?\"","created_at":"2020-07-18T19:36:51.874000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734131595505565783","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"You are also given a uniform to match that of the crew and are told to come work each day preparing the ship. (Mention that your a crewmember to the DM's and you may receive more relevant ship related info if it comes up)","created_at":"2020-07-18T19:36:57.911000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734131620826841228","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"(Good to know","created_at":"2020-07-18T19:37:10.397000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734131673196920902","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"\"Oh, I almost forgot. Now that you are a part of the crew your passage is secured. The sleeping arrangement's are a bit tight, but it's not all that bad.\"","created_at":"2020-07-18T19:37:50.792000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734131842625568859","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"\"The uniform should be enough if anyone asks, but since the crew doesn't know you yet, just let them know Liuetenant Pandy vouches for you.\"","created_at":"2020-07-18T19:38:55.764000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734132115137888337","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"\"Oh that's alright, I'm used to working elbow to elbow, any idea when my first shift starts? I'd be happy to start despite the fact I've just finished an 8 hour shift and replaced a wagon wheel.\" Ozgur says with a smile not showing any signs of fatigue","created_at":"2020-07-18T19:39:29.720000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734132257559937207","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"\"I look forward to working with you. I may have other tasks for the voyage that need to be done. For now just go try and spend that money. It's not going to be much use one the voyage. Report tomorrow morning for outfitting the rest of the ship.\"","created_at":"2020-07-18T19:40:54.333000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734132612452450405","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
