{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"Ozgur passes by <@402542822797869057> as he is leaving giving a polite nod \"Kia ora gnome bro\"","created_at":"2020-07-18T19:45:21.784000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734133734223118448","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MoogleLogic","id":"402542822797869057","is_bot":0,"username":"mooglelogic"},"author_id":"402542822797869057","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"The gaunt gnome stops and raises his eyebrows quizzically at Ozgur. \"My pardons, sir, I do not understand.\"","created_at":"2020-07-18T19:46:44.525000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734134081264025710","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"\"Ah sorry, I said Hello! My name's Ozgur Tepiderez, are you a part of the crew as well?\" The well built rust-red Tiefling asks with a friendly smile, bending down slightly to extend a hand.","created_at":"2020-07-18T19:48:14.787000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734134459850424493","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MoogleLogic","id":"402542822797869057","is_bot":0,"username":"mooglelogic"},"author_id":"402542822797869057","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"\"Ach so! Ja, my name is Johann, Johann Gespenst, Engineer First Classe. Greetings Ozgur, welcome to ze crew\"","created_at":"2020-07-18T19:49:55.614000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734134882749513819","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"\"Thanks alot bro, pardon I don't recognize your accent, where are you from? I'm a kiwi myself, just moved to London bout two years ago.\" Ozgur says adjusting his flat cap.","created_at":"2020-07-18T19:51:46.242000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734135346756976791","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MoogleLogic","id":"402542822797869057","is_bot":0,"username":"mooglelogic"},"author_id":"402542822797869057","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"\"A kiwi? This is fruit, no? I am Germish, I come from Gnermland\" (just in case, not trying to be rude, Johann is ignorant)","created_at":"2020-07-18T19:53:45.334000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-18T19:56:38.178000Z","id":"734135846265159872","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"\"Yeeah nah bro, like the bird not the fruit, I'm from New Zealand.\" Ozgur says with a laugh. \"Never been to Gnermland, maybe you can tell me about it sometime. thankyou for the welcome! Though right now I'm hard out in need of a feed, so I'll be going for some fish n chaps. You interested?\" Ozgur continues as his stomach growls audibly.","created_at":"2020-07-18T19:58:14.664000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734136975917056033","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
